# A table: a full-footprint top on four corner legs. Stateless — a square
# top has no facing to lose, so tables pushed together read as one
# continuous surface. The top is deliberately the cell's whole footprint,
# not inset: an inset top leaves a visible gap between adjacent tables at
# exactly the seam a player builds a long table across.
version 1
shape table
grid 12
states none
box all  0 10 0  12 12 12  # top
box all  1 0 1   3 10 3    # leg
box all  9 0 1   11 10 3   # leg
box all  1 0 9   3 10 11   # leg
box all  9 0 9   11 10 11  # leg
